 "text": "Hey, how's your day been so far? That's common trick. Draw a dot for the nose, a circle for the eye, and the eyebrows in separate lines, then connect them. Give it a try. A half drawn face usually looks more like the person. Start with a dot in the middle, and draw the arches from there. Start the dot from the eye up, and it always looks right. Fun. Keep the nose dot, and you' notice a big improvement.",
